     A**
     A** MENU NAVIGATION FILE - HOMEPAGE AND TOOLBAR
     A**
     A*  CREATED  11/15/12
     A*  C:191
     A*  PROJECT: TRANSFORM
     A**
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*
     A                                      REF(SREFP)
     A          R PNV01                     TEXT('NAVIGATION FILE')
     A            NVSECT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SECTION')
     A****                                        H - HOME PAGE
     A****                                        T - TOOLBAR
     A****                                        N - NAVIGATION MENU (NOT USED HERE)
     A            NVITEM         9  0       COLHDG('ITEM NUMBER')
     A            NVSEQ          9  0       COLHDG('SEQ NUMBER')
     A            NVPARENT       9  0       COLHDG('PARENT' 'ITEM NAME')
     A****                                      0 - IF ROOT ITEM
     A****                                   ITEM NUMBER - IF CHILD
     A            NVTYPE         1          COLHDG('TYPE')
     A****                                      0 - NON LEAF (MENU)
     A****                                      1 - LEAF (EXECUTABLE PGM/URL)
     A****                                      2 - EXECUTABLE BUTTON ON TOOLBAR (PARENT=0)
     A****                                      6 - MENU BUTTON IN OR ON TOOLBAR
     A****                                      7 - EXECUTABLE OPTION IN TOOLBAR
     A            NVACTNTYPE     1          COLHDG('ACTION TYPE')
     A****                                      0 - WEB APPLICATION/WEB PAGE
     A****                                      1 - GENIE MACRO (NOT USED)
     A****                                      2 - RICH DSPF APPLICATION
     A            NVACTN       512          COLHDG('ACTION')
     A****                                      URL FOR WEB APPLICATION
     A****                                      PGM FOR RICH DSPF APPLICATION
     A            NVMNAM        10          COLHDG('SR MENU NAME')
     A****                                      ONLY NEEDED IF ACTNTYPE = 2
     A            NVOPTN         4          COLHDG('SR OPTION')
     A****                                      ONLY NEEDED IF ACTNTYPE = 2
     A            NVTEXT       128          COLHDG('TEXT')
     A            NVICON       128          COLHDG('ICON')
     A            NVWINDOW       1          COLHDG('OPEN IN' 'NEW WINDOW')
     A*****                                 1 = TO OPEN IN NEW WINDOW, ELSE 0
     A            NVONCE         1          COLHDG('OPEN ONCE' 'ONLY')
     A*****                                 1 = TO OPEN ONLY ONCE, ELSE 0
